13:["$","section","Intellectual property and programme names",{"id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Intellectual property and programme names"}],[["$","p","Original site design, explanations, selection frameworks and compilations are protected to the extent permitted by law. Scholarship, university, organisation and employer names and marks belong to their respective owners. Mentioning them does not imply sponsorship or endorsement.",{"children":"Original site design, explanations, selection frameworks and compilations are protected to the extent permitted by law. Scholarship, university, organisation and employer names and marks belong to their respective owners. Mentioning them does not imply sponsorship or endorsement."}]],"$undefined"]}]
14:["$","section","External links and third-party services",{"id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"External links and third-party services"}],[["$","p","Links are provided for convenience and verification. AspireCompass does not control an external site's availability, content, security, fees or data practices. Your relationship with a programme, advertiser or other third party is governed by its own terms and policies.",{"children":"Links are provided for convenience and verification. AspireCompass does not control an external site's availability, content, security, fees or data practices. Your relationship with a programme, advertiser or other third party is governed by its own terms and policies."}]],"$undefined"]}]
15:["$","section","Service changes and liability",{"id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Service changes and liability"}],[["$","p","The website, pages and features may be corrected, changed, suspended or withdrawn. To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, AspireCompass is not liable for losses arising from reliance on outdated information, an external site, missed deadlines, application decisions, malware outside our control or interruption of the service. Nothing in these terms excludes liability that cannot legally be excluded.",{"children":"The website, pages and features may be corrected, changed, suspended or withdrawn. To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, AspireCompass is not liable for losses arising from reliance on outdated information, an external site, missed deadlines, application decisions, malware outside our control or interruption of the service. Nothing in these terms excludes liability that cannot legally be excluded."}]],"$undefined"]}]
16:["$","section","Changes and contact",{"id":"section-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Changes and contact"}],[["$","p","These terms may be revised as the website changes. Continued use after an update means the revised terms apply from the stated date. Questions or reports of misuse can be sent through the contact information published on AspireCompass.",{"children":"These terms may be revised as the website changes. Continued use after an update means the revised terms apply from the stated date. Questions or reports of misuse can be sent through the contact information published on AspireCompass."}]],"$undefined"]}]
